    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.1.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Flight-initiation measurements are scattered rather than centrally standardized.", "Urban habituation and species sorting confound persecution history.";
